<li>Obrok Owok-owok, Ebrek Ewek-ewek, drama, 1976</li>
<li>Bel Geduweh Beh, drama, 1976</li>
<li>Adam Ma'rifat, kumpulan cerpen, 1982?</li>
<li>Orang Jawa Naik Haji, catatan perjalanan ibadah haji, 1983</li>
